<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>

    <%- include("../partials/head", {title: "Refund Policy"}) %>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/legal.css">

</head>

<body>

<%- include("../partials/navbar") %>

<main class="legal-container">

    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>

    <p class="updated">
        Last updated: August 2026
    </p>

    <section>

        <h2>1. General Policy</h2>

        <p>
            We want customers to have a positive experience with EconoMe.
            If you experience a problem with a purchase, please contact
            us so that we can review the situation.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>2. Digital Products</h2>

        <p>
            EconoMe may provide digital educational content, including
            articles, books, materials, quizzes, and premium access.
        </p>

        <p>
            Because digital content may become available immediately
            after purchase, refunds are generally considered on a
            case-by-case basis.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>3. Duplicate Payments</h2>

        <p>
            If you were accidentally charged more than once for the same
            purchase, please contact us. After verification, duplicate
            charges may be eligible for a refund.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>4. Technical Problems</h2>

        <p>
            If you paid for EconoMe content but cannot access it because
            of a technical problem, please contact us before requesting
            a refund. We will first attempt to resolve the problem.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>5. Unauthorized Transactions</h2>

        <p>
            If you believe a transaction was made without your
            authorization, contact us as soon as possible and provide
            the relevant transaction information.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>6. How to Request a Refund</h2>

        <p>
            To request a refund, contact us through our
            <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
        </p>

        <p>
            Please include:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Your name</li>
            <li>The email address used for the purchase</li>
            <li>The product or service purchased</li>
            <li>The approximate purchase date</li>
            <li>The reason for your request</li>
        </ul>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>7. Payment Provider</h2>

        <p>
            Payments may be processed by Paddle. Depending on the
            transaction and applicable rules, refund requests may also
            be handled through the payment provider.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>8. Changes</h2>

        <p>
            EconoMe may update this Refund Policy when necessary.
            Changes will be published on this page.
        </p>

    </section>

</main>

</body>

</html>